<section class="track" id="government"><div><span class="tag">Door 1</span><h2 class="" data-bn="বাংলাদেশ সরকার">Government of Bangladesh</h2><p class="kicker">Ministries, divisions, a2i and local government</p>
<p class="brief60"><b>The 60-second brief.</b> Tested, locally built solutions with the evidence a decision needs. You bring a policy problem; we return tested options, the evidence behind them and the people who built them.</p></div>
<div><div class="offer"><div><b>What you get</b><p>Validated solutions to problems your ministry already has, with the evidence attached.</p></div><div><b>How we work</b><p>Policy-grade briefs written for decision-makers, in Bangla and English.</p></div><div><b>What it opens</b><p>A fair, transparent route for adopting ideas from young citizens.</p></div><div><b>Problems we can work on</b><p>Service delivery at union and upazila level · Digital public services and data · Climate adaptation and disaster warning · Education and stipend transparency</p></div></div>
<div class="steps-inline"><span data-n="1">Briefing</span><span data-n="2">Scoping note</span><span data-n="3">Joint challenge or pilot</span><span data-n="4">Shared results</span></div>
<p class="door-cta"><a class="btn pri" href="#inquiry">Book a briefing</a></p></div></section><section class="track" id="multilateral"><div><span class="tag">Door 2</span><h2 class="" data-bn="বহুপাক্ষিক ও জাতিসংঘ">Multilaterals & UN</h2><p class="kicker">UN agencies, SDG bodies and development partners</p>
<p class="brief60"><b>The 60-second brief.</b> A pipeline of youth-led innovation mapped to the SDGs. You bring a mandate and a goal; we bring validated, locally owned solutions ready for a pilot.</p></div>
<div><div class="offer"><div><b>What you get</b><p>A pipeline of youth-led innovation already mapped to the SDGs.</p></div><div><b>How we work</b><p>Field-ready pilots with independent validation and open data.</p></div><div><b>What it opens</b><p>Joint challenges that bring your mandate to young innovators.</p></div><div><b>Problems we can work on</b><p>Climate resilience on chars and the coast · Child health, water and sanitation · Youth employment and skills · Transparent institutions</p></div></div>
<div class="steps-inline"><span data-n="1">Briefing</span><span data-n="2">Scoping note</span><span data-n="3">Joint challenge or pilot</span><span data-n="4">Shared results</span></div>
<p class="door-cta"><a class="btn pri" href="#inquiry">Book a briefing</a></p></div></section><section class="track" id="industry"><div><span class="tag">Door 3</span><h2 class="" data-bn="শিল্প ও প্রযুক্তি">Industry & Technology</h2><p class="kicker">Global technology and science organisations, local industry</p>
<p class="brief60"><b>The 60-second brief.</b> Talent, field data and real problems for frontier technology. You bring technology and markets; we bring the problems, the field sites and the next generation of builders.</p></div>
<div><div class="offer"><div><b>What you get</b><p>Access to talented young engineers and researchers, early.</p></div><div><b>How we work</b><p>Real problems and field data for frontier technology, from AI to sensors.</p></div><div><b>What it opens</b><p>A venture studio for co-building products with local founders.</p></div><div><b>Problems we can work on</b><p>Bangla language and speech AI · Edge devices for heat, humidity and floods · Compute and data infrastructure · Logistics, energy and agri-tech</p></div></div>
<div class="steps-inline"><span data-n="1">Briefing</span><span data-n="2">Scoping note</span><span data-n="3">Joint challenge or pilot</span><span data-n="4">Shared results</span></div>
